00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:09.436
I never want to be always right

00:00:09.436 --> 00:00:11.543
cause then I can't grow, I can't learn.

00:00:11.543 --> 00:00:14.011
I always want to outdo
everybody else around me.

00:00:14.011 --> 00:00:16.859
I'm a very competitive person,
I'm just quite about it.

00:00:16.859 --> 00:00:18.415
You know I use positive inspiration

00:00:18.415 --> 00:00:21.649
as opposed to like, "oh man
that guy still owes me."

00:00:21.649 --> 00:00:24.602
I keep a constant notepad
