00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:50.579
three Juno awards and six BET awards.

00:00:50.579 --> 00:00:52.530
- He has the most number one singles

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.057
on the Billboard Hot Rap Song's chart.

00:00:55.057 --> 00:00:55.968
- He's Drake,

