00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:02.907
- I don't care about numbers,

00:01:02.907 --> 00:01:04.917
like I don't want number one spots.

00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:07.834
It's just like four, five weeks ago

00:01:09.431 --> 00:01:12.120
