00:01:13.887 --> 00:01:15.731
and then next week, two weeks from now,

00:01:15.731 --> 00:01:17.205
when somebody else does it,

00:01:17.205 --> 00:01:18.943
all these discussions about like I said

00:01:18.943 --> 00:01:21.461
number ones and classics,

00:01:21.461 --> 00:01:23.700
I don't care, I just
want to make good music

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.464
