00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.636
because I disconnect from it.

00:01:37.636 --> 00:01:40.370
My uncle always told me something

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.013
early in my life which stuck with me

00:01:42.013 --> 00:01:44.439
which is that while you're on the journey

00:01:44.439 --> 00:01:47.243
you have to disconnect from the end goal,

00:01:47.243 --> 00:01:49.790
because if you're just
focused on some end goal,

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:51.123
