00:02:04.226 --> 00:02:06.638
Live right now and do the
best you can right now.

00:02:06.638 --> 00:02:08.578
Don't worry about what that end goal is.

00:02:08.578 --> 00:02:11.017
It's great to have goals,
it's great to have dreams,

00:02:11.017 --> 00:02:13.175
